WEBVTT

01:49.479 --> 01:54.990
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.030 --> 01:57.870
[Episode 12]

02:05.430 --> 02:06.430
Hold it straight.

02:06.560 --> 02:07.350
Understood.

02:08.280 --> 02:10.800
You, a wanderer with a mysterious past,

02:11.080 --> 02:13.590
have meddled in court affairs
time and again.

02:13.590 --> 02:15.120
What exactly are you after?

02:15.470 --> 02:16.780
What do you think

02:16.960 --> 02:18.760
my intentions are, General Chu?

02:21.240 --> 02:22.190
I don't know.

02:22.840 --> 02:23.800
But if

02:24.190 --> 02:25.850
Yimeng is also your target...

02:29.230 --> 02:30.370
I advise you

02:30.450 --> 02:32.390
to give up that idea right now.

02:34.470 --> 02:36.750
You, the mighty Lieutenant General
of the Qianyu Army,

02:36.750 --> 02:39.079
think about things like that all day long.

02:42.150 --> 02:44.810
No wonder Miss Song
keeps her distance from you.

02:46.120 --> 02:47.540
My relationship with Yimeng

02:47.540 --> 02:49.079
is none of your concern.

02:50.400 --> 02:51.430
I have no interest

02:51.430 --> 02:52.910
in your personal affairs.

02:53.470 --> 02:54.840
But let me remind you.

02:55.360 --> 02:57.560
What Miss Song cares about most right now

02:57.560 --> 02:59.310
is the South City renovation

02:59.630 --> 03:02.160
and addressing
the people's pressing needs.

03:03.910 --> 03:04.960
That's why you're putting on

03:04.960 --> 03:06.390
a hero's act

03:06.420 --> 03:08.020
to help with the renovation?

03:10.030 --> 03:11.050
Dealing with Nan Heng

03:11.050 --> 03:12.870
and getting involved in the assassination

03:12.870 --> 03:15.070
are just your tricks to win Yimeng over.

03:22.990 --> 03:24.780
So that's what you think.

03:26.120 --> 03:27.120
Then why don't we

03:27.590 --> 03:28.710
make a bet?

03:29.280 --> 03:30.210
Let's see

03:30.240 --> 03:31.900
who can restore the South City

03:31.920 --> 03:33.130
better and faster.

03:33.960 --> 03:35.310
But if you lose,

03:35.750 --> 03:37.350
you call off the engagement.

03:38.470 --> 03:39.910
This is ridiculous.

03:40.060 --> 03:41.730
Marriage is a union between two families.

03:41.730 --> 03:43.130
Why should I bet with you?

03:44.680 --> 03:45.720
Because

03:46.190 --> 03:48.400
there are 61 damaged houses

03:48.460 --> 03:50.590
and 347 displaced people in South City.

03:50.590 --> 03:52.560
Though the court has allocated funds

03:52.560 --> 03:55.190
to finish repairs
before the Beginning of Spring,

03:55.190 --> 03:56.910
both the money and manpower

03:56.930 --> 03:57.880
fall far short.

03:58.370 --> 04:01.100
You'll need help
from the Waning River Crescent.

04:03.030 --> 04:03.840
Otherwise,

04:04.410 --> 04:06.690
when Nan Heng uses this against you,

04:07.560 --> 04:09.630
what will you do then?

04:23.510 --> 04:24.770
As for the renovation,

04:24.890 --> 04:27.120
I'm willing to
let the Waning River Crescent take part.

04:27.120 --> 04:28.560
But I hope you understand

04:29.190 --> 04:31.950
that this renovation affects
the lives of people in the capital.

04:31.950 --> 04:32.950
It's not something
you can bluff your way through

04:32.950 --> 04:35.240
with cheap tricks
from the martial arts world.

04:35.240 --> 04:38.070
If I find out you have ulterior motives,

04:38.360 --> 04:39.159
you won't

04:39.560 --> 04:41.190
get off so easily this time.

04:43.560 --> 04:44.360
Also,

04:45.560 --> 04:47.240
no matter what happens,

04:47.850 --> 04:50.330
I will never use my marriage with Yimeng

04:50.670 --> 04:51.870
as a bargaining chip.

05:01.680 --> 05:02.430
Miss Song,

05:02.430 --> 05:03.870
please calm down.

05:08.650 --> 05:10.050
Look at you,

05:10.070 --> 05:13.800
waving around some worthless thing
like it's supposed to scare me.

05:14.830 --> 05:16.330
Your master

05:16.630 --> 05:18.630
already tried threatening me with a knife
to force some half-baked romance,

05:18.630 --> 05:20.430
and now you're pulling the same trick.

05:20.430 --> 05:21.720
Since when did we even have
a romance storyline?

05:21.720 --> 05:23.190
Who gave you the right
to just make stuff up?

05:23.190 --> 05:24.510
No, Miss Song,

05:25.070 --> 05:25.870
I'm just...

05:25.890 --> 05:27.510
I'm begging you, alright?

05:27.510 --> 05:29.190
I finally landed the job.

05:29.190 --> 05:29.870
Can you please explain

05:29.870 --> 05:31.160
what all those strange terms

05:31.160 --> 05:32.430
actually mean?

05:32.430 --> 05:33.760
Please, I'm begging you.

05:33.760 --> 05:34.870
Please.

05:36.800 --> 05:38.930
We're all just trying to make a living.

05:39.360 --> 05:40.750
You've got it tough too.

05:40.870 --> 05:42.470
Go back and tell your master.

05:42.680 --> 05:44.600
If he has questions,
he can come ask me himself.

05:44.600 --> 05:46.430
Stop giving
the supporting cast a hard time.

05:46.430 --> 05:47.680
No, Miss Song,

05:47.700 --> 05:49.360
I was so foolish.

05:49.750 --> 05:51.870
I didn't realize
how kind and beautiful you truly are.

05:51.870 --> 05:52.750
Can you just tell me

05:52.750 --> 05:54.720
who's really behind all this?

05:56.260 --> 05:57.630
Are you trying to sweet-talk me?

05:57.630 --> 05:58.430
No.

05:58.450 --> 05:59.570
Sweet talk won't work on me.

05:59.570 --> 06:01.450
I've already told your master

06:01.480 --> 06:03.270
that the assassination was my doing alone.

06:03.270 --> 06:04.670
No one else was involved.

06:04.680 --> 06:06.680
This isn't about the assassination.

06:06.680 --> 06:07.810
It's about the fire.

06:08.800 --> 06:10.600
What's the real story behind it?

06:10.680 --> 06:11.750
Tell me, please.

06:15.070 --> 06:15.950
Well...

06:16.040 --> 06:17.500
If you really want to know,

06:17.720 --> 06:18.720
I'll tell you.

06:20.390 --> 06:21.530
It was honestly a coincidence,

06:21.530 --> 06:22.510
part of the plot.

06:22.560 --> 06:23.510
I'm not lying to you.

06:23.510 --> 06:24.270
Really.

06:24.270 --> 06:25.070
I get it.

06:25.360 --> 06:26.760
We're not that close yet,

06:26.830 --> 06:27.960
so you can't open up.

06:28.750 --> 06:29.560
Alright then,

06:29.560 --> 06:31.160
if I badmouth the Seventh Prince,

06:31.160 --> 06:32.870
does that earn me a spot on your side?

06:32.870 --> 06:33.930
Listen carefully.

06:34.040 --> 06:34.750
The Seventh Prince

06:34.750 --> 06:36.270
brings ruin upon
men of loyalty and virtue.

06:36.270 --> 06:36.950
He's

06:36.950 --> 06:38.150
cold and ruthless.

06:38.240 --> 06:40.070
Honestly, he's a complete idiot.

06:40.070 --> 06:41.330
The Seventh Prince is—

06:45.430 --> 06:48.090
Isn't that Fugui,
the one who works for Nan Heng?

06:48.710 --> 06:49.680
Let's beat him up first.

06:49.680 --> 06:50.450
Mr. Li.

06:50.480 --> 06:51.280
Mr. Li.

06:52.010 --> 06:54.000
Everyone around Nan Heng is scheming.

06:54.000 --> 06:55.000
You should leave now.

06:55.000 --> 06:56.659
Don't get involved with them.

06:57.800 --> 06:59.800
Go back and keep your mouth shut.

07:00.120 --> 07:02.120
Don't tell Nan Heng you saw him here.

07:02.680 --> 07:03.560
Otherwise, I'll spread every word

07:03.560 --> 07:05.000
you just said

07:05.000 --> 07:06.210
about the Seventh Prince.

07:06.210 --> 07:07.330
If we die, we die together.

07:07.330 --> 07:08.660
No one gets to walk away.

07:16.480 --> 07:17.270
Come on.

07:18.550 --> 07:19.540
[The Nightwalkers vs Qianyu Army]
[0:0]

07:19.540 --> 07:20.910
[The Nightwalkers vs Qianyu Army]
[1:0]

07:21.360 --> 07:23.560
Bravo!

07:23.580 --> 07:25.480
Bravo!

07:28.040 --> 07:28.970
Here, take this.

07:36.010 --> 07:36.900
[The Nightwalkers vs Qianyu Army]
[1:0]

07:36.900 --> 07:37.830
[The Nightwalkers vs Qianyu Army]
[1:2]

07:37.440 --> 07:40.960
Bravo!

07:44.200 --> 07:45.420
Use some strength.

07:55.290 --> 07:55.430
[The Nightwalkers vs Qianyu Army]
[1:2]

07:55.470 --> 07:56.240
[The Nightwalkers vs Qianyu Army]
[4:2]

07:56.260 --> 07:56.680
[The Nightwalkers]

07:56.510 --> 07:59.360
Bravo!

07:59.560 --> 08:02.050
Awesome!

08:03.120 --> 08:05.510
Bravo!

08:05.510 --> 08:07.570
Mr. Li.

08:07.830 --> 08:09.360
I've sent Shangguan back.

08:09.380 --> 08:11.560
I noticed he washes his hands
after every task.

08:11.560 --> 08:13.390
His skin's practically rubbed raw.

08:13.390 --> 08:14.720
So I let him go.

08:14.870 --> 08:15.480
Alright.

08:16.190 --> 08:17.520
Thank you for your help.

08:20.480 --> 08:21.740
What's wrong with you?

08:22.190 --> 08:23.320
Are you in a bad mood?

08:24.830 --> 08:26.290
Did Chu Guihong bully you?

08:28.480 --> 08:29.510
He bullied me?

08:31.120 --> 08:33.150
Do you really see me as that weak?

08:34.030 --> 08:36.440
When it was Nan Heng,
you tried to protect me.

08:36.440 --> 08:37.480
When it was Chu Guihong,

08:37.480 --> 08:38.840
you did the same.

08:38.860 --> 08:40.120
Even with Fugui just now,

08:40.120 --> 08:41.440
you still stepped in for me.

08:41.440 --> 08:42.200
I...

08:47.520 --> 08:48.440
You...

08:48.440 --> 08:49.930
You might be a hero,

08:50.200 --> 08:52.530
but you're still a supporting character.

08:52.710 --> 08:54.630
I've got plot armor,

08:54.630 --> 08:56.690
so I should be the one protecting you.

08:58.030 --> 08:59.150
Plot armor?

09:01.440 --> 09:02.240
What's that?

09:03.720 --> 09:04.550
It's...

09:05.270 --> 09:06.080
This thing.

09:07.080 --> 09:07.870
This.

09:12.270 --> 09:13.080
There you go.

09:13.440 --> 09:14.700
Now you've got one too.

09:17.320 --> 09:19.030
Thank you all for your hard work.

09:19.030 --> 09:20.720
Come on, food's ready.

09:20.740 --> 09:22.030
Thank you so much.

09:22.030 --> 09:23.080
Be careful.

09:23.080 --> 09:24.150
Thank you so much.

09:24.150 --> 09:26.150
Come and get it.

09:26.190 --> 09:27.320
Take more, please.

09:27.320 --> 09:28.390
Sure thing!

09:31.030 --> 09:33.090
Look at these people from South City.

09:34.180 --> 09:35.890
They probably don't even

09:36.550 --> 09:38.550
get to live a full life in this world.

09:38.960 --> 09:40.200
That day, the fire

09:40.790 --> 09:42.870
was burning for real.

09:43.630 --> 09:45.280
If it weren't for you, Mr. Li,

09:45.570 --> 09:47.570
they might have died just like that.

09:49.080 --> 09:51.140
However, a protagonist like Nan Heng

09:52.020 --> 09:53.720
only cares about power and schemes.

09:53.720 --> 09:55.920
The people's lives mean nothing to him.

09:56.600 --> 09:59.410
All he wants is to outmatch Nan Rui,

09:59.580 --> 10:02.780
even if it means sacrificing
everything the people have,

10:03.150 --> 10:04.480
including their lives.

10:05.230 --> 10:06.380
Is that fair?

10:11.750 --> 10:13.230
So that's why you hate

10:13.320 --> 10:14.710
Nan Heng?

10:15.320 --> 10:17.320
Just because he's the protagonist?

10:25.880 --> 10:27.940
You keep talking about protagonists

10:28.410 --> 10:30.010
and supporting characters,

10:30.840 --> 10:32.900
but I still don't get what that means.

10:37.240 --> 10:38.910
I want to help you change everything

10:38.910 --> 10:40.910
and stand with you against Nan Heng.

10:40.910 --> 10:42.120
But I can't do that

10:42.120 --> 10:44.120
if I don't even understand
what you're saying.

10:44.120 --> 10:45.000
So, Miss Song,

10:46.360 --> 10:47.820
could you explain it to me?

10:50.520 --> 10:51.690
I...

10:54.240 --> 10:55.030
I...

10:57.390 --> 10:58.200
I...

11:00.320 --> 11:01.120
I understand.

11:02.440 --> 11:04.170
When we're not that close,

11:04.240 --> 11:05.970
some secrets are hard to share.

11:06.270 --> 11:07.440
Miss Song, it seems

11:08.000 --> 11:09.400
you still don't trust me.

11:10.590 --> 11:11.920
That's not true, Mr. Li.

11:13.040 --> 11:14.120
I do trust you.

11:15.080 --> 11:15.880
It's just that

11:17.040 --> 11:19.090
if I really told you everything,

11:19.950 --> 11:21.400
you would be afraid of me.

11:27.480 --> 11:28.320
Mr. Li.

11:29.340 --> 11:31.200
You're the most important friend

11:31.360 --> 11:32.900
I have in this world.

11:33.870 --> 11:36.000
You're also the only one
who understands me

11:36.000 --> 11:37.230
and trusts me.

11:38.670 --> 11:39.790
Perhaps...

11:41.750 --> 11:43.010
Perhaps you could even

11:43.270 --> 11:44.720
change my fate.

11:51.850 --> 11:52.750
So,

11:55.000 --> 11:56.480
I really can't lose you.

11:57.490 --> 11:59.030
I'm afraid to lose you.

12:03.110 --> 12:05.110
Please let me keep this secret.

12:05.400 --> 12:06.610
Just this one secret,

12:07.320 --> 12:08.130
can you?

12:09.380 --> 12:13.320
♪ Drifting with fleeting light
into a haze ♪

12:15.100 --> 12:19.930
♪ In the depths of passing time,
who's still waiting ♪

12:20.960 --> 12:23.410
♪ A single glance back ♪

12:24.640 --> 12:26.180
♪ Even if the road ahead is veiled ♪

12:27.610 --> 12:29.480
♪ And the rest of our story
fades unfinished ♪

12:27.670 --> 12:28.390
Sure.

12:30.440 --> 12:35.840
♪ I'll still choose to meet you ♪

12:34.550 --> 12:35.550
Sir.

12:35.630 --> 12:37.790
Thank you for helping us build houses.

12:37.790 --> 12:38.630
Please have some.

12:38.630 --> 12:39.760
Alright, thank you.

12:40.840 --> 12:42.360
Did you wash your hands?

12:44.080 --> 12:45.340
Thank you, little one.

12:45.390 --> 12:46.670
What's your name?

12:46.960 --> 12:48.320
I don't have a name.

12:48.480 --> 12:49.610
That's impossible.

12:49.630 --> 12:50.720
Grandma says

12:50.750 --> 12:52.650
those of us who live in South City

12:52.790 --> 12:54.240
are all lower-class people.

12:54.240 --> 12:56.630
Lower-class people don't need names.

12:57.390 --> 12:58.120
If you don't have a name,

12:58.120 --> 13:00.650
how are you registered
with the authorities?

13:02.360 --> 13:03.360
Well, little one.

13:03.600 --> 13:04.670
Tell me,

13:05.030 --> 13:06.270
what's your father's name?

13:06.270 --> 13:08.000
His name is Passerby A.

13:09.150 --> 13:10.000
Passerby A?

13:11.270 --> 13:12.080
Pass—

13:14.390 --> 13:15.200
Sir.

13:15.580 --> 13:16.750
I'd like to ask,

13:16.910 --> 13:18.320
what's your name?

13:18.360 --> 13:19.560
My name is Passerby B.

13:20.390 --> 13:21.270
Passerby B?

13:22.120 --> 13:23.030
Why?

13:23.390 --> 13:24.370
What do you mean by "why"?

13:24.370 --> 13:26.240
Don't you have your own name?

13:27.670 --> 13:29.360
Passerby B is my name.

13:29.910 --> 13:31.570
You seriously have a problem.

13:33.600 --> 13:34.390
I...

13:35.840 --> 13:36.640
What's wrong?

13:38.010 --> 13:38.960
Nothing.

13:39.630 --> 13:41.130
So all these common people

13:41.360 --> 13:43.000
don't have their own names.

13:43.910 --> 13:45.390
I didn't know "Passerby"

13:45.600 --> 13:46.360
was such a common surname

13:46.360 --> 13:48.200
in the capital.

13:49.320 --> 13:51.180
Quite an elegant surname indeed.

14:01.120 --> 14:01.910
Little one.

14:03.150 --> 14:04.720
Since your father's surname

14:04.720 --> 14:05.630
is Passerby,

14:06.460 --> 14:07.580
from now on,

14:07.790 --> 14:08.850
you shall be called

14:09.080 --> 14:10.030
Passerby Pancake.

14:10.030 --> 14:10.910
How's that?

14:11.440 --> 14:12.600
Thank you, Sir.

14:12.790 --> 14:13.600
Here,

14:13.600 --> 14:14.270
have this pancake.

14:14.270 --> 14:15.140
Take a big bite.

14:16.320 --> 14:19.180
Passerby C.
["C" sounds like "pancake" in Chinese]

14:24.480 --> 14:26.140
It's as if everything is stuck

14:26.150 --> 14:28.630
inside a fabricated, prewritten world.

14:32.960 --> 14:34.240
So handsome!

14:34.270 --> 14:36.030
Mr. Li's skills are truly extraordinary.

14:36.030 --> 14:38.030
My Lady, he's the one, definitely the one!

14:38.030 --> 14:38.910
Just days ago,

14:38.910 --> 14:40.910
weren't you
speaking highly of General Chu?

14:40.910 --> 14:42.480
Now you've switched sides.

14:42.870 --> 14:44.870
Before, I was just inexperienced,

14:44.960 --> 14:46.200
thinking that of all men in the world,

14:46.200 --> 14:47.630
only General Chu was the best.

14:47.630 --> 14:49.600
But now, after hearing
Miss's stories every day,

14:49.600 --> 14:52.130
I think Mr. Li
is even better than General Chu.

14:52.150 --> 14:54.150
You two are what we call daily followers,

14:54.150 --> 14:56.280
switching fandoms at the drop of a hat.

14:57.030 --> 14:58.120
Switching...

14:58.240 --> 14:59.200
But My Lady,

14:59.600 --> 15:01.240
what are your feelings

15:01.270 --> 15:02.360
toward Mr. Li now?

15:02.750 --> 15:04.270
If you like him,

15:04.510 --> 15:07.640
why not break off your engagement
and marry him instead?

15:08.710 --> 15:10.240
What are you talking about?

15:11.390 --> 15:12.270
Besides,

15:12.670 --> 15:14.150
the broken engagement plot

15:14.150 --> 15:15.410
is still a long way off.

15:15.480 --> 15:16.670
For now, I'd be counting my blessings

15:16.670 --> 15:18.750
if I could just slip out of

15:19.360 --> 15:21.240
Nan Heng's clutches safely.

15:21.550 --> 15:24.840
-My Lady.
-My Lady, please tell us more.

15:25.190 --> 15:26.230
Stop gossiping.

15:25.820 --> 15:30.720
[Slacker Escape Plan]

15:30.720 --> 15:37.200
[Li Shiliu]

15:50.720 --> 15:52.750
From what I know about Nan Heng,

15:52.750 --> 15:54.750
he's just an ambitious,

15:54.750 --> 15:55.870
ruthless,

15:55.870 --> 15:56.910
and heartless man.

15:56.910 --> 15:57.870
He commits all kinds of wicked deeds,

15:57.870 --> 15:58.910
falsely accuses loyal officials,

15:58.910 --> 15:59.870
and inflicts suffering upon women.

15:59.870 --> 16:01.240
He's a bad guy, you know?

16:01.260 --> 16:02.630
He kills without even blinking.

16:02.630 --> 16:04.150
Nan Heng has committed plenty of

16:04.150 --> 16:05.900
wicked deeds over the years, hasn't he?

16:05.900 --> 16:07.940
Nan Heng is a sinister villain.

16:07.960 --> 16:10.020
However, a protagonist like Nan Heng

16:10.610 --> 16:12.400
only cares about power and schemes.

16:12.400 --> 16:14.600
The people's lives mean nothing to him.

16:14.660 --> 16:15.680
Anyway,

16:15.960 --> 16:17.220
he's not a good person.

16:35.840 --> 16:36.630
Fugui!

16:37.080 --> 16:37.870
Come in!

16:41.550 --> 16:42.410
Your Highness.

16:42.560 --> 16:43.360
Let me ask you.

16:43.390 --> 16:44.390
Do you also think

16:44.720 --> 16:46.510
I am a person who only cares about power

16:46.510 --> 16:48.360
and ignores the lives of the people?

16:48.360 --> 16:49.820
What do you mean by "also"?

16:51.440 --> 16:53.520
No, it's impossible.

16:53.960 --> 16:55.710
Your Highness

16:55.910 --> 16:57.370
is known for your kindness

16:57.960 --> 16:59.080
and warmth—

16:59.570 --> 17:01.270
truly a gentleman

17:01.490 --> 17:03.090
and a great hero of the realm.

17:04.720 --> 17:06.780
Do you really believe your own words?

17:11.510 --> 17:13.270
Since you don't believe it yourself,

17:13.270 --> 17:15.470
she certainly won't believe it either.

17:15.640 --> 17:16.440
She?

17:19.480 --> 17:21.750
Accompany me
to the Song Residence tomorrow.

17:21.750 --> 17:23.150
I have questions for her.

17:24.510 --> 17:25.640
Yes, Your Highness.

17:25.810 --> 17:29.510
[Song Residence]

17:30.880 --> 17:32.030
Twenty-five.

17:32.030 --> 17:33.310
Sixteen,

17:33.310 --> 17:34.270
seventeen.

17:36.200 --> 17:37.910
We're short on timber lately.

17:38.110 --> 17:39.470
To keep the project on schedule,

17:39.470 --> 17:41.070
we need to use materials sparingly.

17:41.070 --> 17:41.960
Remember, you two—

17:41.960 --> 17:44.270
everything here must be properly sorted

17:44.270 --> 17:45.590
and counted once a day,

17:45.590 --> 17:47.110
and any shortages reported right away.

17:47.110 --> 17:48.720
That's how we avoid mistakes.

17:48.720 --> 17:50.590
My Lady, you're impressive!

17:52.000 --> 17:53.330
I'm just helping Mr. Li.

17:54.070 --> 17:55.920
He's done so much for the people,

17:55.920 --> 17:57.440
so I should do my part too,

17:57.440 --> 17:58.160
right?

18:11.680 --> 18:13.010
What are you doing here?

18:15.110 --> 18:16.480
Is this how you treat

18:16.500 --> 18:18.920
the person who saved you

18:18.920 --> 18:21.180
from being charged with assassination?

18:21.860 --> 18:22.790
Your Highness,

18:22.790 --> 18:24.590
mind your gentlemanly conduct.

18:26.080 --> 18:28.080
I need to speak with Miss Song alone.

18:29.280 --> 18:30.640
Both of you, leave now.

18:32.240 --> 18:33.250
Your Highness,

18:33.270 --> 18:35.480
th-they don't know anything.

18:35.480 --> 18:36.800
Please don't frighten them.

18:36.800 --> 18:37.680
Besides,

18:38.060 --> 18:39.270
what is it

18:39.400 --> 18:41.200
that cannot be said in their presence?

18:41.200 --> 18:42.800
Why must we speak in private?

18:43.200 --> 18:43.960
Miss Song,

18:44.000 --> 18:45.430
His Highness suggests

18:45.590 --> 18:46.720
it might be a bit stuffy in here

18:46.720 --> 18:48.880
and perhaps the ladies
would appreciate some fresh air.

18:48.880 --> 18:49.680
Ladies,

18:49.790 --> 18:50.590
please.

18:57.420 --> 18:59.070
It's quite stuffy in here.

18:59.070 --> 19:00.800
I need to get some fresh air too.

19:01.710 --> 19:02.770
What are you doing?

19:05.710 --> 19:06.760
First question:

19:08.510 --> 19:09.610
To you,

19:10.270 --> 19:11.600
what kind of person am I?

19:14.560 --> 19:16.160
A truly admirable person.

19:18.310 --> 19:19.920
I want you to tell the truth.

19:21.110 --> 19:23.290
How is that not the truth?

19:23.310 --> 19:25.160
Even though Your Highness
has tried to kill me

19:25.160 --> 19:26.030
so many times,

19:26.030 --> 19:27.630
you always let me walk away.

19:27.690 --> 19:30.310
Such magnanimity,
rare even among top celebrities,

19:30.310 --> 19:32.250
combined with your remarkable foresight—

19:32.250 --> 19:34.180
you're truly an admirable person.

19:36.960 --> 19:37.750
Fine.

19:38.960 --> 19:40.420
Then the second question:

19:41.400 --> 19:42.860
What is a "top celebrity"?

19:43.350 --> 19:45.080
What does "protagonist" mean?

19:45.550 --> 19:46.410
And what is this

19:46.550 --> 19:47.810
"script" you speak of?

19:50.600 --> 19:52.710
Everyone keeps asking me these questions.

19:52.710 --> 19:54.160
I-I really feel suffocated.

19:54.160 --> 19:55.680
I really need to go out and breathe

19:55.680 --> 19:57.070
some fresh air.

19:57.090 --> 19:59.200
I've searched through
all the books in the Wenyuan Library

19:59.200 --> 20:00.680
and questioned
all the scholars in the Hanlin Academy,

20:00.680 --> 20:02.740
yet no one knows anything about this.

20:05.370 --> 20:07.080
I was just saying it casually.

20:07.270 --> 20:08.790
Your Highness, seriously,

20:08.790 --> 20:11.440
why do you bother
remembering such trivial things?

20:11.440 --> 20:12.840
Just saying it casually?

20:13.400 --> 20:14.310
Once is fine,

20:15.310 --> 20:16.510
but what about twice?

20:16.640 --> 20:17.350
Three times?

20:17.350 --> 20:18.790
Four times? Five times?

20:19.680 --> 20:21.680
You once said I was the protagonist.

20:22.300 --> 20:24.310
Now you're calling me a top celebrity.

20:24.310 --> 20:25.110
You also mentioned that everything

20:25.110 --> 20:26.510
between us is part of some script rule.

20:26.510 --> 20:28.110
What does all that mean?

20:34.270 --> 20:35.070
Did I...

20:38.530 --> 20:39.870
Did I say that?

20:41.510 --> 20:42.310
Song Yimeng.

20:44.200 --> 20:45.600
I'm begging you to tell me

20:47.550 --> 20:49.510
what you're hiding from me.

20:55.440 --> 20:56.510
Your Highness,

20:56.720 --> 20:58.240
do you have any manners at all?

20:58.240 --> 21:00.400
How can you be so rude to a girl?

21:07.720 --> 21:08.510
Fine,

21:08.660 --> 21:09.990
I'll tell you today.

21:10.400 --> 21:11.880
A top celebrity
is someone with top traffic,

21:11.880 --> 21:13.240
and a script
is the foundation of a show.

21:13.240 --> 21:14.590
You, who only knows how to
use force when facing problems,

21:14.590 --> 21:15.070
who hasn't even learned basic

21:15.070 --> 21:15.790
English vocabulary,

21:15.790 --> 21:16.510
do you understand?

21:16.510 --> 21:17.440
Do you understand?

21:17.440 --> 21:18.500
Do you understand?

21:20.680 --> 21:22.050
You don't understand.

21:22.240 --> 21:23.310
Not only do you not understand,

21:23.310 --> 21:24.400
you kill without remorse,

21:24.400 --> 21:25.270
you slaughter the innocent.

21:25.270 --> 21:26.110
You don't really want to know

21:26.110 --> 21:27.440
what the real script is about.

21:27.440 --> 21:28.920
You just think I know more than you,

21:28.920 --> 21:30.480
you think I'm hiding everything from you.

21:30.480 --> 21:31.480
You want to control everyone,

21:31.480 --> 21:32.790
but you don't trust anyone.

21:32.790 --> 21:33.640
Am I right,

21:33.640 --> 21:34.500
Your Highness?

21:46.510 --> 21:49.200
Have I successfully mind-controlled him?

21:49.510 --> 21:50.310
Fine,

21:52.030 --> 21:53.830
you're right about everything.

21:53.960 --> 21:55.890
I did use force against you before,

21:58.000 --> 21:59.060
but let me tell you.

22:01.360 --> 22:02.940
Apart from this matter,

22:04.240 --> 22:06.300
I have never killed innocent people.

22:10.720 --> 22:12.270
I don't trust anyone,

22:13.070 --> 22:14.510
because no one has ever trusted me,

22:14.510 --> 22:15.750
not even you.

22:18.350 --> 22:19.160
I...

22:22.370 --> 22:23.500
You should know that

22:24.550 --> 22:25.590
things in this world

22:25.590 --> 22:28.210
are not what
they appear to be on the surface.

22:28.230 --> 22:30.760
What people say
isn't necessarily the truth.

22:30.990 --> 22:31.830
On the battlefield,

22:31.830 --> 22:33.270
it's kill or be killed.

22:33.510 --> 22:34.240
In the imperial court,

22:34.240 --> 22:36.450
it's even more
dangerous than the frontier.

22:36.450 --> 22:38.710
If I don't fight desperately to survive,

22:38.710 --> 22:40.910
then I'll be the one driven to a dead end.

22:47.640 --> 22:48.500
Song Yimeng.

22:49.920 --> 22:50.720
If

22:52.000 --> 22:53.800
you truly want to understand me,

22:54.950 --> 22:56.440
don't use your eyes.

23:24.270 --> 23:25.870
Who wants to understand you?

23:35.790 --> 23:37.050
Everyone present here

23:37.880 --> 23:40.550
is an expert in weapon forging.

23:41.830 --> 23:43.720
Our Chief Master has gone to great lengths

23:43.720 --> 23:45.850
to invite you all from the Huai region,

23:46.030 --> 23:47.360
spending several days,

23:47.440 --> 23:49.100
yet there's been no progress.

23:52.830 --> 23:55.630
You're making it
very difficult for me to explain.

23:56.700 --> 23:57.970
Mr. Shangguan,

23:58.480 --> 24:00.360
it's not that we're incompetent.

24:00.440 --> 24:02.880
The blades you want
must be forged from fine steel,

24:02.880 --> 24:04.920
but nowadays all the quality iron mines

24:04.920 --> 24:06.550
are under imperial control.

24:06.570 --> 24:08.550
To forge steel blades from ordinary iron,

24:08.550 --> 24:10.880
that's... that's simply impossible!

24:10.880 --> 24:11.310
Indeed.

24:11.310 --> 24:12.960
So if I provide you with fine iron,

24:12.960 --> 24:14.290
you could forge it then?

24:18.640 --> 24:20.160
Sir, what you don't know is

24:20.270 --> 24:22.110
the fine iron needs to be tempered

24:22.110 --> 24:23.640
before it can become steel.

24:23.750 --> 24:25.110
And this tempering method

24:25.110 --> 24:26.920
is known only to Lord Qianyu.

24:27.110 --> 24:28.350
In my youth,

24:28.550 --> 24:30.070
I was fortunate enough
to apprentice in the Qianyu Army

24:30.070 --> 24:31.800
under a blade-forging master.

24:31.830 --> 24:34.350
Even though he served
in the army for decades,

24:34.350 --> 24:36.680
he never obtained Lord Qianyu's formula.

24:37.000 --> 24:37.590
So...

24:37.590 --> 24:39.960
In the end, you still can't forge it.

24:41.880 --> 24:44.110
Guards! Take them away.

24:45.310 --> 24:46.110
Move along.

24:55.200 --> 24:56.200
What should we do?

24:57.400 --> 24:59.460
We'll have to target the Qianyu Army.

25:04.070 --> 25:06.510
Go to the South City
and tell the Chief Master

25:06.510 --> 25:08.310
that our mission remains unaccomplished,

25:08.310 --> 25:10.480
and we need to find
another way through Chu Guihong.

25:10.480 --> 25:11.270
Yes.

25:14.510 --> 25:16.380
Bravo! Bravo!

25:16.410 --> 25:18.200
Bravo! Bravo!

25:22.480 --> 25:23.270
General,

25:23.750 --> 25:25.480
what are they doing over there?

25:26.110 --> 25:28.400
Are they here to help
or just cause trouble?

25:28.400 --> 25:30.030
Chattering all day long,

25:30.070 --> 25:32.270
they're clearly
disrupting military discipline.

25:32.270 --> 25:33.510
Let them do their thing,

25:33.510 --> 25:34.720
we'll do ours.

25:35.200 --> 25:36.880
Only by completing this before next month

25:36.880 --> 25:38.110
can we help His Majesty

25:38.110 --> 25:39.000
and His Highness

25:39.000 --> 25:40.330
put their minds at ease.

25:42.550 --> 25:43.350
General,

25:43.680 --> 25:44.590
the Waning River Crescent

25:44.590 --> 25:46.390
is full of riffraff.

25:46.590 --> 25:47.400
When it comes to speed,

25:47.400 --> 25:49.050
we really can't compete with them.

25:49.050 --> 25:50.180
When the time comes,

25:50.880 --> 25:54.680
you won't really break off
your engagement with Miss Song, will you?

26:00.550 --> 26:02.210
That's none of your business.

26:02.270 --> 26:03.670
Focus on your own duties.

26:15.070 --> 26:15.640
Let's go.

26:16.750 --> 26:17.560
Give it to me,

26:17.850 --> 26:18.910
give it back!

26:20.200 --> 26:21.220
Over there.

26:22.920 --> 26:24.520
I have no strength at all now.

26:30.030 --> 26:31.610
It's a five-strand hemp rope.

26:31.610 --> 26:33.090
Remove one strand from inside,

26:33.090 --> 26:34.890
and the rope loses its strength.

26:35.480 --> 26:36.510
From the outside,

26:36.720 --> 26:37.880
it's hard to notice.

26:38.640 --> 26:39.440
Come on,

26:39.440 --> 26:40.100
let's do it.

26:40.270 --> 26:41.070
Ronghua.

26:42.480 --> 26:44.610
If the General finds out about this...

26:44.750 --> 26:46.070
Then let him beat me.

26:46.640 --> 26:48.440
It's better than
letting his beloved Miss Song

26:48.440 --> 26:50.700
be snatched away by that street ruffian.

26:51.000 --> 26:52.350
Haven't you noticed lately

26:52.350 --> 26:53.160
that Miss Song

26:53.160 --> 26:54.890
keeps coming to the South City?

26:54.930 --> 26:56.550
When has she ever come to see our General?

26:56.550 --> 26:57.270
Every time,

26:57.570 --> 26:59.570
she's only here to see that ruffian.

27:02.680 --> 27:03.590
Let me tell you,

27:04.320 --> 27:05.520
if you're my brother,

27:05.640 --> 27:06.900
then help me with this.

27:12.240 --> 27:13.840
The Second Master says so...

27:14.720 --> 27:15.510
Understood.

27:16.030 --> 27:17.630
Go back and tell Shangguan He

27:17.640 --> 27:18.720
not to act rashly.

27:18.790 --> 27:19.590
Yes, sir.

27:40.800 --> 27:43.000
There's something wrong with the rope.

28:01.170 --> 28:02.550
Someone has tampered with the rope.

28:02.550 --> 28:04.310
If you keep fighting me,
the building will collapse.

28:04.310 --> 28:05.830
Don't tell me your men did this.

28:05.830 --> 28:07.160
I had no idea about this.

28:07.790 --> 28:09.000
You were sneaking around just now.

28:09.000 --> 28:10.160
What are you scheming this time?

28:10.160 --> 28:11.310
The guilty party accuses first.

28:11.310 --> 28:12.920
You came to
South City with ulterior motives.

28:12.920 --> 28:13.880
If you don't explain yourself,

28:13.880 --> 28:14.720
I won't let you stay any longer.

28:14.720 --> 28:15.720
You talk about morality and righteousness,

28:15.720 --> 28:17.200
but your actions are despicable.

28:17.200 --> 28:19.130
You're the one who shouldn't stay.

29:39.790 --> 29:41.720
The Qianyu Army's bruise medicine

29:41.960 --> 29:42.820
works wonders.

29:49.160 --> 29:49.960
Thanks.

30:30.960 --> 30:32.510
Most people think this pill

30:32.550 --> 30:33.590
is taken orally,

30:33.790 --> 30:36.790
yet you know
the Qianyu Army's method of application.

30:39.210 --> 30:40.870
What's so special about that?

30:41.110 --> 30:42.170
This medicine

30:42.310 --> 30:44.510
is sold everywhere in the black market.

30:49.330 --> 30:50.550
Military supplies

30:51.200 --> 30:53.600
have somehow leaked into the black market,

30:54.160 --> 30:57.000
and my subordinates
have disregarded my orders.

30:58.680 --> 31:00.680
My family's legacy has come to this,

31:00.830 --> 31:02.000
how ridiculous.

31:26.680 --> 31:27.480
Wait,

31:29.200 --> 31:31.400
aren't you afraid it might be poisoned?

31:33.160 --> 31:34.270
You wouldn't dare.

31:35.030 --> 31:36.310
If I were poisoned to death,

31:36.310 --> 31:38.070
your entire Waning River Crescent

31:38.070 --> 31:39.270
would go down with me.

31:49.450 --> 31:50.260
It's wine?

31:51.270 --> 31:52.030
What,

31:53.790 --> 31:54.830
is carrying wine

31:55.160 --> 31:56.200
a crime too?

31:58.510 --> 32:00.480
Why are you speaking with such sarcasm?

32:00.480 --> 32:01.720
Look who's talking,

32:02.000 --> 32:03.530
you're no better yourself.

32:19.290 --> 32:21.750
If you weren't genuinely concerned
for the people of South City,

32:21.750 --> 32:24.280
you wouldn't have
gone to such lengths today.

32:24.840 --> 32:27.640
I've had many
misunderstandings about you before,

32:27.640 --> 32:28.440
but today

32:28.880 --> 32:31.540
I'll tentatively
believe you're a good person.

32:32.310 --> 32:33.680
Then I must thank you

32:35.200 --> 32:36.660
for your tentative trust.

32:40.490 --> 32:41.550
There you go again.

32:48.800 --> 32:50.200
About the rope incident,

32:50.550 --> 32:52.150
the Qianyu Army wronged you,

32:53.160 --> 32:54.200
I owe you a favor.

32:54.510 --> 32:55.910
What can I do to repay you?

33:00.240 --> 33:01.900
The method of weapon forging,

33:02.110 --> 33:03.040
can you share it?

33:04.960 --> 33:06.690
Coveting the method of weapon forging

33:06.690 --> 33:07.750
is a serious crime.

33:11.750 --> 33:13.850
Qianyu Army's sharp weapons

33:14.310 --> 33:16.110
are meant to protect Great Jing,

33:16.920 --> 33:18.160
but is Great Jing

33:18.180 --> 33:20.240
only protected by your Qianyu Army?

33:21.030 --> 33:22.670
I wonder if this method

33:23.160 --> 33:25.240
were shared among all military forces,

33:25.240 --> 33:28.000
how many soldiers
at the border would be saved?

33:29.510 --> 33:30.450
Perhaps

33:31.270 --> 33:32.600
in the Pingrong Battle,

33:33.680 --> 33:35.610
many lives could have been spared.

33:41.790 --> 33:43.650
I understand what you're saying,

33:44.070 --> 33:45.370
but if this method

33:45.510 --> 33:47.350
falls into the wrong hands,

33:48.960 --> 33:49.750
then

33:50.270 --> 33:51.590
how many people

33:51.750 --> 33:53.750
would die needlessly because of it?

33:55.750 --> 33:58.160
The person with
ulterior motives you're referring to

33:58.160 --> 33:59.220
is Nan Heng, right?

34:02.440 --> 34:03.270
In any case,

34:03.880 --> 34:05.140
he's not a good person.

34:06.110 --> 34:08.850
You needn't investigate
the method of weapon forging anymore.

34:08.850 --> 34:10.040
My father is dead,

34:11.100 --> 34:12.110
and there will never be

34:12.110 --> 34:14.040
any truth about this secret again.

34:21.550 --> 34:23.449
Since we're talking about Nan Heng,

34:23.449 --> 34:25.120
I have a few questions

34:25.150 --> 34:26.510
I'd like to ask you.

34:27.840 --> 34:28.909
What questions?

34:29.810 --> 34:31.080
That first time we met,

34:31.590 --> 34:33.500
when I brought people
to investigate the Waning River Crescent,

34:33.500 --> 34:35.030
why were you so prepared?

34:35.239 --> 34:36.800
Did you perhaps get information

34:36.800 --> 34:38.230
from Nan Heng in advance?

34:40.489 --> 34:42.820
Why would I need
help from others for this?

34:43.139 --> 34:45.000
Everyone at Waning River Crescent
is a person of the martial arts world,

34:45.000 --> 34:46.320
from all walks of life.

34:46.570 --> 34:47.590
Every day we're living with our heads

34:47.590 --> 34:49.150
on the chopping block.

34:50.040 --> 34:53.170
Don't you think I'd
at least get this bit of information?

34:53.480 --> 34:55.400
You came marching in broad daylight

34:55.400 --> 34:57.460
with the Qianyu Army to investigate.

34:57.660 --> 34:59.620
If I couldn't
get this information in advance,

34:59.620 --> 35:01.900
how would we
Nightwalkers at Waning River Crescent

35:01.900 --> 35:03.460
have survived until today?

35:04.150 --> 35:04.960
Fine.

35:05.760 --> 35:07.560
Even if what you say makes sense,

35:08.030 --> 35:09.460
the three of us clearly agreed

35:09.460 --> 35:11.460
to assassinate Nan Heng together.

35:12.150 --> 35:13.480
So why weren't you there

35:13.660 --> 35:14.700
that night?

35:18.870 --> 35:19.670
Fine.

35:20.400 --> 35:21.190
I admit it.

35:22.890 --> 35:24.340
I was scared, okay?

35:25.270 --> 35:26.590
You and Miss Song are both

35:26.590 --> 35:27.480
children of high officials.

35:27.480 --> 35:29.230
Me? I'm just a nobody
from the martial arts world.

35:29.230 --> 35:30.230
Assassinating a prince is something

35:30.230 --> 35:32.210
that could easily cost me my head.

35:32.250 --> 35:33.910
Couldn't I have a backup plan?

35:34.960 --> 35:36.490
Besides, don't forget that

35:37.370 --> 35:39.130
if I hadn't been cautious,

35:39.180 --> 35:40.770
you, General Chu, would have

35:40.770 --> 35:41.970
arrested me that day.

35:51.550 --> 35:53.010
I finally understand now.

35:53.480 --> 35:54.280
You still

35:54.800 --> 35:56.110
don't trust me.

35:57.670 --> 35:58.800
But think about it.

35:59.550 --> 36:02.020
I'm just a nobody
from the martial arts world.

36:02.020 --> 36:04.750
Why would a prince
conspire with someone like me?

36:05.070 --> 36:05.880
Besides,

36:05.880 --> 36:07.710
if you don't trust me, General Chu,

36:07.710 --> 36:09.400
how could Nan Heng trust me?

36:11.010 --> 36:11.810
Tell me,

36:12.710 --> 36:13.670
could he?

36:17.510 --> 36:18.510
I see that you

36:19.000 --> 36:20.800
were born into a noble family,

36:21.630 --> 36:23.030
sheltered from reality.

36:23.560 --> 36:24.920
You think everything

36:25.150 --> 36:27.150
is much simpler than it actually is.

36:41.360 --> 36:42.150
Once,

36:43.480 --> 36:44.410
I had a friend who

36:45.190 --> 36:46.450
told me the same thing.

36:48.730 --> 36:50.220
He said I was naive

36:50.960 --> 36:53.090
and thought everything was too simple

36:54.890 --> 36:55.960
I didn't realize

36:57.000 --> 36:58.150
haste makes waste

36:58.760 --> 37:01.020
and true strength comes through trials.

37:02.880 --> 37:06.570
[19 years ago]

37:04.480 --> 37:05.280
Oh dear!

37:06.670 --> 37:08.040
Are you hurt?

37:08.360 --> 37:09.700
What should we do now?

37:11.840 --> 37:12.540
This...

37:14.880 --> 37:16.270
Bruise medicine.

37:16.320 --> 37:17.630
Gao family's secret recipe.

37:17.630 --> 37:18.440
Want some?

37:21.480 --> 37:27.350
♪ I leave the book aside,
though I haven't finished reading it ♪

37:25.040 --> 37:27.970
This is for external use only,
not to be taken orally.

37:30.620 --> 37:36.350
♪ I know one day I can have
a glimpse of the ending ♪

37:31.840 --> 37:32.840
Give me your hand.

37:37.400 --> 37:39.540
You're that prince from the Gao family, aren't you?

37:39.540 --> 37:40.870
My name is Chu Guihong.

37:39.690 --> 37:43.740
♪ Life is unpredictable ♪

37:42.060 --> 37:44.130
I know they don't
let you ride horses in the palace.

37:44.130 --> 37:46.010
From now on, my horse is your horse.

37:44.650 --> 37:47.480
♪ Who can get rid of perplexity ♪

37:46.950 --> 37:48.550
I won't ride your horse for nothing.

37:48.380 --> 37:53.060
♪ And find the answer he yearns for? ♪

37:48.670 --> 37:51.070
I'll tell you the secret medicine formula.

37:51.510 --> 37:52.590
That's great!

37:52.590 --> 37:54.150
I want to give it to my father,

37:54.150 --> 37:55.590
so the soldiers of the Qianyu Army

37:55.590 --> 37:57.240
can all use this miracle medicine.

37:57.040 --> 38:00.230
If the wind changes my past

37:59.920 --> 38:01.550
Your riding skills are really impressive.

38:01.550 --> 38:02.650
Teach me, please.

38:01.780 --> 38:04.920
If you write about me

38:02.800 --> 38:03.480
No.

38:03.480 --> 38:05.020
I'll call you big brother.

38:05.110 --> 38:05.920
Still no.

38:05.920 --> 38:07.450
I'll call you master.

38:06.090 --> 38:12.540
♪ I’ll see how many kinds of destiny will be made for me ♪ Look

38:07.480 --> 38:08.320
No.

38:08.860 --> 38:11.110
I'll give you the Qianyu Military Manual.

38:11.110 --> 38:11.920
Do you want it?

38:15.070 --> 38:18.240
Let the moonlight see how many lines I love you

38:19.900 --> 38:23.030
Let me run against the south wall

38:22.100 --> 38:25.000
[This attack is invincible]

38:24.170 --> 38:30.360
Even if it's destiny, it doesn't matter to me

38:33.000 --> 38:33.590
Here.

38:43.670 --> 38:44.840
Don't ever tell anyone

38:44.840 --> 38:46.440
that I taught you how to ride.

38:47.310 --> 38:52.880
♪ People's demeanor varies
in this world of hustle and bustle ♪

38:48.030 --> 38:50.230
Will I never learn to ride properly?

38:51.480 --> 38:52.510
One fall from a horse

38:52.510 --> 38:53.800
is nothing to be afraid of.

38:53.800 --> 38:55.590
Even those battle-hardened generals

38:55.590 --> 38:58.100
know that even good riders fall sometimes.

38:55.990 --> 39:02.340
♪ Are they all bound by
destiny at the same time? ♪

39:00.230 --> 39:02.530
But I'm learning so slowly,

39:02.930 --> 39:05.140
you've been teaching me
for almost half a month now.

39:05.090 --> 39:08.950
♪ A simple move can lead to
multiple major changes ♪

39:06.590 --> 39:08.040
You're inexperienced,

39:08.280 --> 39:10.280
thinking many things
are simpler than they are,

39:10.060 --> 39:13.040
♪ Who can find out the truth? ♪

39:11.100 --> 39:13.100
not knowing that haste makes waste.

39:13.110 --> 39:14.230
Steel is forged
through a hundred refinements.

39:14.230 --> 39:19.010
♪ Is it a bluff or a real match? ♪

39:16.150 --> 39:17.530
Haste makes waste.

39:18.440 --> 39:21.100
Steel is forged
through a hundred refinements.

39:22.090 --> 39:25.570
♪ Setting sun, help me
weather through the big snow ♪

39:26.450 --> 39:27.760
Mr. Li, you're right.

39:26.630 --> 39:30.080
♪ I'll wait till the next chapter
to get sorrowful ♪

39:28.430 --> 39:30.760
I've been thoughtless about many things.

39:30.860 --> 39:37.700
♪ Every word resonates with me
like dancing notes on the paper ♪

39:31.190 --> 39:33.320
Thank you for your wise words tonight.

39:42.480 --> 39:43.280
Mr. Li.

39:44.630 --> 39:47.290
Whether you're
conspiring with Nan Heng or not,

39:47.360 --> 39:48.860
getting entangled with him

39:48.860 --> 39:50.200
will never end well.

39:52.510 --> 39:53.320
Remember,

39:53.410 --> 39:57.340
♪ Wind, be with me
in the quest for an ideal ♪

39:54.290 --> 39:56.890
the further away
you stay from him, the better.

39:58.010 --> 40:01.160
♪ Brush and ink,
stand with me on the cliff ♪

40:02.340 --> 40:09.010
♪ My heart measures
the waves I've cleaved ♪

40:11.400 --> 40:14.990
♪ Setting sun, help me
weather through the big snow ♪

40:16.050 --> 40:20.480
♪ I'll wait till the next chapter
to get sorrowful ♪

40:17.210 --> 40:19.670
[You only give it
to me after drinking it all]

40:22.190 --> 40:23.670
[Still exactly the same as before]

40:22.590 --> 40:30.690
♪ Every word resonates with me
like dancing notes on the paper ♪

41:07.480 --> 41:08.310
Chief...

41:24.100 --> 41:27.780
[19 years ago]

41:59.920 --> 42:02.090
[Young Nan Rui]

42:19.000 --> 42:20.200
Rui is compassionate

42:20.840 --> 42:22.240
and refuses to take life,

42:23.150 --> 42:24.630
very good, very good.

42:30.630 --> 42:31.800
Guihong is brave,

42:32.000 --> 42:33.480
a true son of a military family,

42:33.480 --> 42:34.280
commendable,

42:34.400 --> 42:35.600
indeed commendable.

42:35.800 --> 42:37.200
Thank you, Your Majesty.

42:43.840 --> 42:45.110
Excessive killing,

42:45.190 --> 42:46.400
reeks of blood,

42:47.070 --> 42:47.840
absurd,

42:48.110 --> 42:49.240
absolutely absurd.

42:50.440 --> 42:51.230
Father.

42:51.720 --> 42:52.510
Rui.

42:54.030 --> 42:55.030
Let's go play over there,

42:55.030 --> 42:55.830
shall we?

42:56.000 --> 42:56.760
I...

42:56.760 --> 42:57.190
Guihong.

42:57.190 --> 42:59.070
Have found a really fun place.

42:59.350 --> 42:59.980
Father.

43:04.180 --> 43:06.540
[Empress Chu Yurong]

43:07.150 --> 43:08.110
Let me carry you.

43:10.320 --> 43:11.370
Let's go.

43:25.550 --> 43:26.800
Heng, when we return to the palace today,

43:26.800 --> 43:28.880
ride in my carriage.

43:37.800 --> 43:38.590
Come.

43:42.240 --> 43:42.950
Come.

43:47.770 --> 43:48.840
What are you doing?

43:50.790 --> 43:52.480
That's the right expression.

43:53.760 --> 43:55.560
When I was your age,

43:55.710 --> 43:57.630
I would constantly
pester my father and brother

43:57.630 --> 43:59.050
to go horse racing and hunting,

43:59.050 --> 44:00.510
having the time of my life.

44:01.060 --> 44:02.950
If you carry too many worries,

44:03.000 --> 44:04.410
you'll age quickly,

44:04.770 --> 44:05.900
and once you're old,

44:07.120 --> 44:09.780
you can never return to your youth.

44:13.560 --> 44:15.010
His Majesty is

44:15.480 --> 44:18.050
still so childish despite his age.

44:18.780 --> 44:20.330
He's not ignoring you

44:20.460 --> 44:23.260
because he's just
competing with Chancellor Gao.

44:25.100 --> 44:25.910
Eat up.

44:27.080 --> 44:28.170
When you're done,

44:28.760 --> 44:30.280
I'll take you hunting for

44:30.280 --> 44:31.540
an even bigger rabbit.

44:31.820 --> 44:33.210
We can make

44:33.240 --> 44:35.700
a warm scarf
for your mother, how about that?

45:14.840 --> 45:16.590
This path doesn't lead to the palace.

45:16.590 --> 45:18.220
Mother brought me here

45:18.550 --> 45:20.070
to catch rabbits.

45:20.110 --> 45:21.030
You're lying!

45:25.230 --> 45:26.400
Are you going to eat or not?

45:25.730 --> 45:28.370
[Cold Palace]

45:26.440 --> 45:27.670
If not, you'll starve.

45:27.670 --> 45:28.480
Come out.

45:28.690 --> 45:29.480
Leave us.

45:30.480 --> 45:31.280
Yes.

45:31.710 --> 45:32.510
Open the door.

45:34.680 --> 45:36.410
Where are the things I gave you?

45:37.070 --> 45:38.200
Give them back to me.

45:41.320 --> 45:42.180
Give them back!

45:43.840 --> 45:44.640
I burned them.

46:01.590 --> 46:02.280
Wait.

46:05.760 --> 46:07.520
I didn't kill your aunt,

46:08.730 --> 46:09.730
do you believe me?

46:17.030 --> 46:18.890
So you and Chu Guihong

46:19.000 --> 46:20.710
have such a history together,

46:23.760 --> 46:25.280
how fascinating.

46:29.450 --> 46:32.740
Those who abandon me and disturb my heart

46:34.190 --> 46:35.250
are all obstacles,

46:37.820 --> 46:39.070
not to be longed for.

46:40.880 --> 46:41.680
Didn't you two

46:42.280 --> 46:44.000
just reconcile?

46:47.710 --> 46:49.070
What reconciliation?

46:50.320 --> 46:52.310
Even if we patch things up temporarily,

46:52.310 --> 46:54.110
we'll end up as strangers again.

46:55.030 --> 46:56.690
Besides, the one on the throne

46:57.150 --> 46:59.230
constantly reminds me:

46:59.880 --> 47:02.360
when two tigers fight, one must perish.

47:03.510 --> 47:04.590
If I don't win,

47:06.510 --> 47:07.920
then I can only die.
